# Scenario snapshot

Two presentation-ready tables (No conversion, With conversion) over a six-year
window, styled after the planning deck's "Assets, Income & Taxes" slide so an
advisor can screenshot them into a deck. One "Starting in" picker drives both.

- `snapshotTable.ts` is pure: it only reads `ProjectionRow` fields, never
  recomputes money. Keep it that way.
- Sections: assets (each tax-deferred and after-tax account in
  `accountsInDisplayOrder`, real-estate equity, Roth total, and a yearly
  conversion row only when the scenario converts), income (monthly, per
  source, RMD rows kept when they pay anywhere in the projection), cash flow
  (monthly; a deposits row shows when the plan has deposits, since surplus
  nets them).
- It sits above the year-by-year table: nothing may go below that table in
  the results scroller.
